{"id":"vol8-02","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-02/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":407.28,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.94,"text":"front recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what you hear. There will be time","words":[["front",0.0,0.22],["recordings,",0.22,0.82],["and",1.4,1.6],["you",1.6,1.76],["will",1.76,1.88],["have",1.88,2.06],["to",2.06,2.18],["answer",2.18,2.46],["questions",2.46,3.06],["on",3.06,3.38],["what",3.38,3.58],["you",3.58,3.78],["hear.",3.78,4.14],["There",4.82,5.32],["will",5.32,5.46],["be",5.46,5.62],["time",5.62,5.94]]},{"start":5.94,"end":11.22,"text":"for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance to check your work.","words":[["for",5.94,6.18],["you",6.18,6.3],["to",6.3,6.4],["read",6.4,6.72],["the",6.72,6.98],["instructions",6.98,7.54],["and",7.54,7.88],["questions,",7.88,8.28],["and",8.84,9.2],["you",9.2,9.38],["will",9.38,9.5],["have",9.5,9.68],["a",9.68,9.82],["chance",9.82,10.12],["to",10.12,10.32],["check",10.32,10.66],["your",10.66,10.86],["work.",10.86,11.22]]},{"start":12.46,"end":21.66,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only. The test is in four parts. Write all your answers","words":[["All",12.46,12.72],["the",12.72,12.86],["recordings",12.86,13.3],["will",13.3,13.68],["be",13.68,13.84],["played",13.84,14.26],["once",14.26,14.72],["only.",14.72,15.48],["The",17.08,17.26],["test",17.26,17.68],["is",17.68,18.42],["in",18.42,18.56],["four",18.56,18.94],["parts.",18.94,19.64],["Write",20.38,20.78],["all",20.78,21.06],["your",21.06,21.22],["answers",21.22,21.66]]},{"start":21.66,"end":28.08,"text":"in the listening question booklet. At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes","words":[["in",21.66,22.3],["the",22.3,22.42],["listening",22.42,22.76],["question",22.76,23.34],["booklet.",23.34,23.84],["At",24.78,25.1],["the",25.1,25.24],["end",25.24,25.42],["of",25.42,25.54],["the",25.54,25.64],["test,",25.64,26.0],["you",26.24,26.68],["will",26.68,26.84],["be",26.84,26.94],["given",26.94,27.22],["ten",27.22,27.62],["minutes",27.62,28.08]]},{"start":28.08,"end":36.44,"text":"to transfer your answers to an answer sheet. Now turn to part 1 on page 2 of your question booklet.","words":[["to",28.08,28.36],["transfer",28.36,28.86],["your",28.86,29.14],["answers",29.14,29.52],["to",29.52,29.82],["an",29.82,30.02],["answer",30.02,30.3],["sheet.",30.3,30.64],["Now",32.72,33.06],["turn",33.06,33.28],["to",33.28,33.5],["part",33.5,33.7],["1",33.7,34.14],["on",34.14,34.56],["page",34.56,34.9],["2",34.9,35.4],["of",35.4,35.54],["your",35.54,35.64],["question",35.64,35.98],["booklet.",35.98,36.44]]},{"start":42.26,"end":48.8,"text":"Part 1. You will hear a man called Peter phoning a sports center manager about a job.","words":[["Part",42.26,42.42],["1.",42.42,42.92],["You",44.2,44.2],["will",44.2,44.36],["hear",44.36,44.58],["a",44.58,44.78],["man",44.78,45.02],["called",45.02,45.44],["Peter",45.44,45.94],["phoning",45.94,46.48],["a",46.48,46.74],["sports",46.74,46.9],["center",46.9,47.3],["manager",47.3,47.78],["about",47.78,48.2],["a",48.2,48.4],["job.",48.4,48.8]]},{"start":49.7,"end":77.4,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 1-4. Now listen carefully and answer questions 1-4.","words":[["First",49.7,50.32],["you",50.32,50.54],["have",50.54,50.72],["some",50.72,50.88],["time",50.88,51.3],["to",51.3,51.58],["look",51.58,51.72],["at",51.72,51.86],["questions",51.86,52.28],["1",52.28,52.84],["-4.",52.84,53.38],["Now",73.72,74.14],["listen",74.14,74.5],["carefully",74.5,74.98],["and",74.98,75.32],["answer",75.32,75.7],["questions",75.7,76.16],["1",76.16,76.76],["-4.",76.76,77.4]]},{"start":80.78,"end":84.16,"text":"Hello, Fernley Sports Center. How can I help you?","words":[["Hello,",80.78,81.38],["Fernley",81.74,82.16],["Sports",82.16,82.42],["Center.",82.42,83.04],["How",83.3,83.46],["can",83.46,83.66],["I",83.66,83.76],["help",83.76,83.96],["you?",83.96,84.16]]},{"start":84.16,"end":89.28,"text":"Yes, I'd like to apply for one of the lifeguard jobs you advertise this week.","words":[["Yes,",84.16,85.0],["I'd",85.54,85.92],["like",85.92,86.02],["to",86.02,86.22],["apply",86.22,86.6],["for",86.6,86.86],["one",86.86,87.1],["of",87.1,87.22],["the",87.22,87.32],["lifeguard",87.32,87.76],["jobs",87.76,88.12],["you",88.12,88.3],["advertise",88.3,88.7],["this",88.7,89.06],["week.",89.06,89.28]]},{"start":89.88,"end":95.1,"text":"Right, we can do that now over the phone. I'll just need some information from you.","words":[["Right,",89.88,90.54],["we",90.74,90.86],["can",90.86,91.06],["do",91.06,91.2],["that",91.2,91.42],["now",91.42,91.76],["over",91.76,92.2],["the",92.2,92.34],["phone.",92.34,92.66],["I'll",93.02,93.34],["just",93.34,93.56],["need",93.56,93.76],["some",93.76,93.96],["information",93.96,94.52],["from",94.52,94.86],["you.",94.86,95.1]]},{"start":95.56,"end":97.06,"text":"Let me get a form.","words":[["Let",95.56,96.16],["me",96.16,96.32],["get",96.32,96.54],["a",96.54,96.66],["form.",96.66,97.06]]},{"start":98.18,"end":101.4,"text":"Okay, so let's start with your name.","words":[["Okay,",98.18,98.88],["so",99.28,99.88],["let's",99.88,100.38],["start",100.38,100.6],["with",100.6,100.86],["your",100.86,101.1],["name.",101.1,101.4]]},{"start":102.34,"end":103.32,"text":"Peter Smith.","words":[["Peter",102.34,102.66],["Smith.",102.66,103.32]]},{"start":104.02,"end":106.92,"text":"Okay, can you let me have your home address?","words":[["Okay,",104.02,104.4],["can",105.06,105.46],["you",105.46,105.6],["let",105.6,105.76],["me",105.76,105.92],["have",105.92,106.14],["your",106.14,106.3],["home",106.3,106.56],["address?",106.56,106.92]]},{"start":108.16,"end":112.48,"text":"It's 130 South Main Street, Lake Elsinore.","words":[["It's",108.16,108.86],["130",108.86,109.56],["South",109.56,110.04],["Main",110.04,110.4],["Street,",110.4,110.8],["Lake",111.5,111.78],["Elsinore.",111.78,112.48]]},{"start":112.48,"end":118.34,"text":"Okay. I'm new around here. Can you spell that for me?","words":[["Okay.",112.48,113.86],["I'm",114.44,115.24],["new",115.24,115.64],["around",115.64,116.16],["here.",116.16,116.54],["Can",116.88,117.14],["you",117.14,117.34],["spell",117.34,117.66],["that",117.66,117.9],["for",117.9,118.16],["me?",118.16,118.34]]},{"start":119.28,"end":124.72,"text":"Yes, it's E-L-S-I-N-O-R-E.","words":[["Yes,",119.28,119.62],["it's",119.88,120.3],["E",120.3,120.9],["-L",120.9,121.58],["-S",121.58,122.38],["-I",122.38,122.92],["-N",122.92,123.56],["-O",123.56,123.92],["-R",123.92,124.32],["-E.",124.32,124.72]]},{"start":125.9,"end":130.42,"text":"Okay, got that. And your phone number?","words":[["Okay,",125.9,126.78],["got",127.6,128.3],["that.",128.3,128.64],["And",129.2,129.64],["your",129.64,129.82],["phone",129.82,130.12],["number?",130.12,130.42]]},{"start":131.0,"end":137.86,"text":"My home number's 951-674-3124.","words":[["My",131.0,131.56],["home",131.56,131.84],["number's",131.84,132.44],["951",132.44,134.02],["-674",134.02,135.96],["-3124.",135.96,137.86]]},{"start":137.86,"end":140.76,"text":"but it's best to ring me on my cell phone.","words":[["but",137.86,138.56],["it's",138.56,138.82],["best",138.82,139.0],["to",139.0,139.3],["ring",139.3,139.42],["me",139.42,139.6],["on",139.6,139.84],["my",139.84,140.04],["cell",140.04,140.4],["phone.",140.4,140.76]]},{"start":141.28,"end":146.94,"text":"That's 0778 96245.","words":[["That's",141.28,141.86],["0778",141.86,143.92],["96245.",143.92,146.94]]},{"start":147.8,"end":148.4,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",147.8,148.4]]},{"start":150.08,"end":152.16,"text":"Now, what do you do?","words":[["Now,",150.08,150.68],["what",151.16,151.56],["do",151.56,151.74],["you",151.74,151.86],["do?",151.86,152.16]]},{"start":152.54,"end":155.52,"text":"Are you still in college or are you working full-time?","words":[["Are",152.54,152.68],["you",152.68,152.86],["still",152.86,153.1],["in",153.1,153.26],["college",153.26,153.76],["or",153.76,154.26],["are",154.26,154.46],["you",154.46,154.58],["working",154.58,154.86],["full",154.86,155.18],["-time?",155.18,155.52]]},{"start":156.36,"end":158.7,"text":"I'm in my second year here at Fernley","words":[["I'm",156.36,156.88],["in",156.88,157.0],["my",157.0,157.16],["second",157.16,157.46],["year",157.46,157.76],["here",157.76,158.02],["at",158.02,158.24],["Fernley",158.24,158.7]]},{"start":158.7,"end":162.54,"text":"and this vacation I've got a job as a part-time waiter.","words":[["and",158.7,159.48],["this",159.48,159.74],["vacation",159.74,160.24],["I've",160.24,160.98],["got",160.98,161.1],["a",161.1,161.2],["job",161.2,161.5],["as",161.5,161.7],["a",161.7,161.84],["part",161.84,162.0],["-time",162.0,162.26],["waiter.",162.26,162.54]]},{"start":163.06,"end":165.76,"text":"Okay. I guess if you're at Fernley College","words":[["Okay.",163.06,163.4],["I",163.9,164.14],["guess",164.14,164.36],["if",164.36,164.62],["you're",164.62,164.78],["at",164.78,164.9],["Fernley",164.9,165.28],["College",165.28,165.76]]},{"start":165.76,"end":169.32,"text":"you'll be studying physical education? And they all seem to do that there.","words":[["you'll",165.76,165.96],["be",165.96,166.06],["studying",166.06,166.44],["physical",166.44,166.74],["education?",166.74,167.38],["And",167.9,168.1],["they",168.1,168.24],["all",168.24,168.4],["seem",168.4,168.6],["to",168.6,168.76],["do",168.76,168.88],["that",168.88,169.08],["there.",169.08,169.32]]},{"start":169.66,"end":174.02,"text":"That's right. Then I hope to go on and coach baseball in high school.","words":[["That's",169.66,170.0],["right.",170.0,170.2],["Then",170.9,171.18],["I",171.18,171.6],["hope",171.6,171.76],["to",171.76,171.88],["go",171.88,172.02],["on",172.02,172.34],["and",172.34,172.46],["coach",172.46,172.8],["baseball",172.8,173.36],["in",173.36,173.6],["high",173.6,173.78],["school.",173.78,174.02]]},{"start":174.42,"end":178.5,"text":"Something like that. I guess it all depends on how I do in my final exams.","words":[["Something",174.42,174.7],["like",174.7,174.94],["that.",174.94,175.16],["I",175.7,175.9],["guess",175.9,176.04],["it",176.04,176.18],["all",176.18,176.3],["depends",176.3,176.6],["on",176.6,176.96],["how",176.96,177.18],["I",177.18,177.38],["do",177.38,177.56],["in",177.56,177.7],["my",177.7,177.84],["final",177.84,178.12],["exams.",178.12,178.5]]},{"start":179.22,"end":180.66,"text":"Okay, sounds good to me.","words":[["Okay,",179.22,179.68],["sounds",179.9,180.14],["good",180.14,180.36],["to",180.36,180.5],["me.",180.5,180.66]]},{"start":184.22,"end":190.22,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 5 to 10.","words":[["Before",184.22,184.66],["you",184.66,184.94],["hear",184.94,185.22],["the",185.22,185.42],["rest",185.42,185.68],["of",185.68,185.82],["the",185.82,185.9],["conversation,",185.9,186.5],["you",187.1,187.38],["have",187.38,187.58],["some",187.58,187.78],["time",187.78,188.2],["to",188.2,188.48],["look",188.48,188.64],["at",188.64,188.76],["questions",188.76,189.1],["5",189.1,189.7],["to",189.7,189.92],["10.",189.92,190.22]]},{"start":220.8,"end":224.1,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 5 to 10.","words":[["Now",220.8,221.08],["listen",221.08,221.36],["and",221.36,221.78],["answer",221.78,222.24],["questions",222.24,222.78],["5",222.78,223.44],["to",223.44,223.7],["10.",223.7,224.1]]},{"start":227.49,"end":231.15,"text":"Now, the next part of the form deals with qualifications.","words":[["Now,",227.49,228.01],["the",228.21,228.31],["next",228.31,228.53],["part",228.53,228.87],["of",228.87,228.99],["the",228.99,229.07],["form",229.07,229.45],["deals",229.45,230.15],["with",230.15,230.49],["qualifications.",230.49,231.15]]},{"start":231.99,"end":234.13,"text":"Do you have the Water Safety Certificate?","words":[["Do",231.99,232.15],["you",232.15,232.29],["have",232.29,232.47],["the",232.47,232.65],["Water",232.65,232.93],["Safety",232.93,233.37],["Certificate?",233.37,234.13]]},{"start":234.51,"end":236.57,"text":"We absolutely insist on that.","words":[["We",234.51,234.77],["absolutely",234.77,235.41],["insist",235.41,235.97],["on",235.97,236.35],["that.",236.35,236.57]]},{"start":236.87,"end":237.43,"text":"Yes, I do.","words":[["Yes,",236.87,237.13],["I",237.19,237.25],["do.",237.25,237.43]]},{"start":238.01,"end":241.43,"text":"So how long will it last before you have to do a refresher course?","words":[["So",238.01,238.31],["how",238.31,238.55],["long",238.55,238.85],["will",238.85,239.05],["it",239.05,239.19],["last",239.19,239.59],["before",239.59,239.91],["you",239.91,240.13],["have",240.13,240.29],["to",240.29,240.41],["do",240.41,240.55],["a",240.55,240.69],["refresher",240.69,241.19],["course?",241.19,241.43]]},{"start":242.07,"end":244.81,"text":"I took it last November, so it will run out in October.","words":[["I",242.07,242.33],["took",242.33,242.51],["it",242.51,242.67],["last",242.67,242.99],["November,",242.99,243.51],["so",243.67,243.87],["it",243.87,243.99],["will",243.99,244.05],["run",244.05,244.27],["out",244.27,244.43],["in",244.43,244.55],["October.",244.55,244.81]]},{"start":245.47,"end":246.41,"text":"Okay, good.","words":[["Okay,",245.47,245.85],["good.",246.11,246.41]]},{"start":247.03,"end":249.95,"text":"Now, what about work experience as a lifeguard?","words":[["Now,",247.03,247.47],["what",247.57,247.73],["about",247.73,247.95],["work",247.95,248.31],["experience",248.31,249.01],["as",249.01,249.41],["a",249.41,249.55],["lifeguard?",249.55,249.95]]},{"start":250.49,"end":253.25,"text":"Well, I've had about four months' experience.","words":[["Well,",250.49,250.89],["I've",251.41,251.69],["had",251.69,251.83],["about",251.83,252.03],["four",252.03,252.35],["months'",252.35,252.59],["experience.",252.75,253.25]]},{"start":254.01,"end":255.79,"text":"Which swimming pool was that at?","words":[["Which",254.01,254.37],["swimming",254.37,254.75],["pool",254.75,255.09],["was",255.09,255.31],["that",255.31,255.53],["at?",255.53,255.79]]},{"start":255.79,"end":259.91,"text":"I need to have details of your employer, obviously, so we can get a reference.","words":[["I",255.79,256.29],["need",256.29,256.45],["to",256.45,256.63],["have",256.63,256.73],["details",256.73,257.11],["of",257.11,257.41],["your",257.41,257.55],["employer,",257.55,258.09],["obviously,",258.11,258.67],["so",258.93,259.07],["we",259.07,259.21],["can",259.21,259.37],["get",259.37,259.49],["a",259.49,259.57],["reference.",259.57,259.91]]},{"start":260.39,"end":262.59,"text":"Oh, it was at the beach here in Fernley.","words":[["Oh,",260.39,260.73],["it",260.79,260.89],["was",260.89,261.05],["at",261.05,261.21],["the",261.21,261.35],["beach",261.35,261.73],["here",261.73,262.03],["in",262.03,262.19],["Fernley.",262.19,262.59]]},{"start":263.11,"end":265.89,"text":"I can get the number of the person you need to contact.","words":[["I",263.11,263.43],["can",263.43,263.61],["get",263.61,263.81],["the",263.81,264.01],["number",264.01,264.37],["of",264.37,264.63],["the",264.63,264.75],["person",264.75,265.05],["you",265.05,265.23],["need",265.23,265.35],["to",265.35,265.47],["contact.",265.47,265.89]]},{"start":266.59,"end":266.91,"text":"Good.","words":[["Good.",266.59,266.91]]},{"start":267.55,"end":270.87,"text":"And do you have any other additional skills I can put down?","words":[["And",267.55,267.83],["do",267.83,268.05],["you",268.05,268.15],["have",268.15,268.35],["any",268.35,268.67],["other",268.67,268.97],["additional",268.97,269.47],["skills",269.47,269.97],["I",269.97,270.19],["can",270.19,270.35],["put",270.35,270.55],["down?",270.55,270.87]]},{"start":271.41,"end":272.75,"text":"You can put down diving.","words":[["You",271.41,271.81],["can",271.81,271.95],["put",271.95,272.11],["down",272.11,272.37],["diving.",272.37,272.75]]},{"start":273.39,"end":275.03,"text":"I've done that for a long time now.","words":[["I've",273.39,273.63],["done",273.63,273.79],["that",273.79,273.99],["for",273.99,274.21],["a",274.21,274.33],["long",274.33,274.49],["time",274.49,274.79],["now.",274.79,275.03]]},{"start":275.55,"end":279.43,"text":"I'm also keen on rock climbing, but that's not really relevant here.","words":[["I'm",275.55,275.83],["also",275.83,276.19],["keen",276.19,276.55],["on",276.55,276.73],["rock",276.73,277.01],["climbing,",277.01,277.31],["but",277.55,277.89],["that's",277.89,278.25],["not",278.25,278.53],["really",278.53,278.83],["relevant",278.83,279.15],["here.",279.15,279.43]]},{"start":279.91,"end":280.39,"text":"No.","words":[["No.",279.91,280.39]]},{"start":281.13,"end":281.69,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",281.13,281.69]]},{"start":281.69,"end":285.29,"text":"and I need to ask when you would prefer to work.","words":[["and",281.69,282.45],["I",282.45,282.91],["need",282.91,283.15],["to",283.15,283.37],["ask",283.37,283.75],["when",283.75,284.05],["you",284.05,284.29],["would",284.29,284.47],["prefer",284.47,284.81],["to",284.81,285.01],["work.",285.01,285.29]]},{"start":285.73,"end":290.09,"text":"You can choose either Saturday mornings or anytime Monday to Friday.","words":[["You",285.73,285.95],["can",285.95,286.19],["choose",286.19,286.57],["either",286.57,286.97],["Saturday",286.97,287.39],["mornings",287.39,287.75],["or",287.75,288.39],["anytime",288.39,288.99],["Monday",288.99,289.57],["to",289.57,289.81],["Friday.",289.81,290.09]]},{"start":290.87,"end":293.07,"text":"We've got enough people on Sundays at the moment.","words":[["We've",290.87,291.17],["got",291.17,291.33],["enough",291.33,291.55],["people",291.55,291.85],["on",291.85,292.07],["Sundays",292.07,292.49],["at",292.49,292.73],["the",292.73,292.81],["moment.",292.81,293.07]]},{"start":293.83,"end":298.05,"text":"Well, not Monday to Friday because I'm at the restaurant weekday evenings.","words":[["Well,",293.83,294.37],["not",294.61,294.87],["Monday",294.87,295.17],["to",295.17,295.35],["Friday",295.35,295.69],["because",295.69,296.43],["I'm",296.43,296.63],["at",296.63,296.71],["the",296.71,296.85],["restaurant",296.85,297.23],["weekday",297.23,297.73],["evenings.",297.73,298.05]]},{"start":298.65,"end":302.89,"text":"Okay. We open at six. Could you start that early?","words":[["Okay.",298.65,299.21],["We",299.95,300.19],["open",300.19,300.53],["at",300.53,300.75],["six.",300.75,301.15],["Could",301.83,302.07],["you",302.07,302.21],["start",302.21,302.43],["that",302.43,302.65],["early?",302.65,302.89]]},{"start":303.45,"end":306.31,"text":"No, that's fine. I prefer that to working late.","words":[["No,",303.45,303.65],["that's",303.71,303.87],["fine.",303.87,304.13],["I",304.81,305.03],["prefer",305.03,305.33],["that",305.33,305.61],["to",305.61,305.83],["working",305.83,306.01],["late.",306.01,306.31]]},{"start":306.97,"end":316.31,"text":"Okay, now I need to speak to the committee who run the sports center here, but you should hear back from us pretty soon, and then they'll probably arrange an interview.","words":[["Okay,",306.97,307.45],["now",308.03,308.45],["I",308.45,308.61],["need",308.61,308.75],["to",308.75,308.95],["speak",308.95,309.15],["to",309.15,309.31],["the",309.31,309.43],["committee",309.43,309.77],["who",309.77,310.13],["run",310.13,310.37],["the",310.37,310.57],["sports",310.57,310.77],["center",310.77,311.27],["here,",311.27,311.67],["but",311.85,312.23],["you",312.23,312.53],["should",312.53,312.77],["hear",312.77,312.99],["back",312.99,313.23],["from",313.23,313.45],["us",313.45,313.63],["pretty",313.63,313.87],["soon,",313.87,314.27],["and",314.31,314.43],["then",314.43,314.57],["they'll",314.57,314.77],["probably",314.77,315.21],["arrange",315.21,315.69],["an",315.69,315.89],["interview.",315.89,316.31]]},{"start":316.77,"end":317.73,"text":"Thanks very much.","words":[["Thanks",316.77,317.23],["very",317.23,317.47],["much.",317.47,317.73]]},{"start":318.15,"end":327.35,"text":"Great. Now, before you go, I'd just like to ask you how you found out about our advertisement. We always ask this. Was it from the newspaper or the radio?","words":[["Great.",318.15,318.57],["Now,",318.99,319.23],["before",319.31,319.51],["you",319.51,319.77],["go,",319.77,320.01],["I'd",320.29,320.67],["just",320.67,320.79],["like",320.79,320.99],["to",320.99,321.13],["ask",321.13,321.43],["you",321.43,321.61],["how",321.61,321.79],["you",321.79,321.95],["found",321.95,322.21],["out",322.21,322.49],["about",322.49,322.75],["our",322.75,322.97],["advertisement.",322.97,323.65],["We",324.31,324.49],["always",324.49,324.73],["ask",324.73,325.03],["this.",325.03,325.27],["Was",325.71,325.83],["it",325.83,325.95],["from",325.95,326.09],["the",326.09,326.23],["newspaper",326.23,326.55],["or",326.55,326.97],["the",326.97,327.11],["radio?",327.11,327.35]]},{"start":327.97,"end":333.27,"text":"I heard the advertisement this morning when I was driving into college. I don't usually read the local paper.","words":[["I",327.97,328.45],["heard",328.45,328.61],["the",328.61,328.75],["advertisement",328.75,329.29],["this",329.29,329.59],["morning",329.59,329.89],["when",329.89,330.07],["I",330.07,330.21],["was",330.21,330.33],["driving",330.33,330.61],["into",330.61,330.85],["college.",330.85,331.17],["I",331.69,331.89],["don't",331.89,332.01],["usually",332.01,332.35],["read",332.35,332.59],["the",332.59,332.73],["local",332.73,332.91],["paper.",332.91,333.27]]},{"start":333.27,"end":338.71,"text":"All right. Thanks. Well, that's all. Hope to see you soon.","words":[["All",333.27,333.61],["right.",333.61,334.33],["Thanks.",334.69,334.81],["Well,",335.73,336.25],["that's",336.49,336.75],["all.",336.75,337.01],["Hope",337.39,337.99],["to",337.99,338.19],["see",338.19,338.35],["you",338.35,338.47],["soon.",338.47,338.71]]},{"start":342.02,"end":348.58,"text":"That is the end of Part 1. You now have one minute to check your answers to Part 1.","words":[["That",342.02,342.56],["is",342.56,342.72],["the",342.72,342.9],["end",342.9,343.28],["of",343.28,343.46],["Part",343.46,343.66],["1.",343.66,344.04],["You",344.92,345.12],["now",345.12,345.4],["have",345.4,345.76],["one",345.76,346.06],["minute",346.06,346.44],["to",346.44,346.7],["check",346.7,347.0],["your",347.0,347.26],["answers",347.26,347.66],["to",347.66,347.96],["Part",347.96,348.16],["1.",348.16,348.58]]}]}